iKestrel
Copyright 2026 Ted Mecimore

iKestrel follows the design of iOwl and of iKnow (https://github.com/8rank/iKnow,
by the Eighth Rank), both licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0: local
only, read-only on every handle, a fresh token at every start, counts-only
reports, and "not measured is not zero".

Third-party code included:

  public/force.js
    The force-directed graph that draws the spider map. Copied unmodified from
    iOwl (public/js/force.js), which carries it from iKnow. Licensed under the
    Apache License, Version 2.0.

  public/web.css, the rules for .force-* classes
    Adapted from iOwl's public/css/app.css. Licensed under the Apache License,
    Version 2.0. Changes: colour tokens mapped onto iKestrel's palette, and the
    expanded panel widened to 360px.

Everything else in this repository is iKestrel's own code.
